    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes RPG content such as exploration, self building teams, battles, and growth, as well as multiplayer gameplay such as interacting with other players, forming guilds, and competing in battles. Players can cultivate their own characters, and their teams can freely explore the world map. They can explore different caves, sects, and strongholds, learn different martial arts, and recruit different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Feature]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Open worldview and plot setting, free martial arts activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/48d00d38ef699c0269545c5fa8beb775.avif?t=1754622208\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leisure gameplay mode, idle growth fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/3e6bd6c1dc2a52aa32174409453a0bca.avif?t=1754622208\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ultra high character engagement, recruiting and sparring with all NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/615ebaa9dfcbe5ea594b63c7baab6c17.avif?t=1754622208\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multi directional partner pairing, high freedom cultivation and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/170f2c0e1361d6783bb3967655613428.avif?t=1754622208\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Numerous anticipated follow-up features have been released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
